[I] C implementation of the mustache template specification

[T] mustach is a small C implementation of the mandatory part of the
[T] mustache template specification. Optional wrappers allow rendering
[T] templates directly from json-c, jansson or cJSON objects, and a mustach
[T] command line tool is included.

[U] https://gitlab.com/jobol/mustach

[A] Mustach Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

